Re: "acquiring" the intrinsic aggravate monsters

I've discovered some logic to having this intrinsic applied to my
characters despite not attacking w/o warning, keeping a healthy pet
etc, etc.

Basically, it occurs when you turn into a "bully".  It tends to happen
without even realizing it, but most often when you get a really good
armor class with a good (read blessed) weapon.  You become fearless, and
attack everything which you're "allowed" to (i.e. without warning). It
happens so fast you might not even have noticed that the "f" or "d" that
you just killed was labelled as "little".

But from that point on, "aggravate" monsters becomes you!  Somehow, the
other denizens of the dungeon know that you go out of your way to kick
the relatively defenseless (even if they attacked first).

So, the moral is -- leave those "little" ones alone!

Hope this helps!

